Khara consoles weeping Śūrpaṇakhā and asks cause --- Śūrpaṇakhā reports fourteen heroes slain by Rāma --- Śūrpaṇakhā confesses terror and seeks refuge --- Śūrpaṇakhā begs Khara to kill Daṇḍaka thorn Rāma --- Śūrpaṇakhā threatens suicide before Khara if refused --- Śūrpaṇakhā doubts Khara can face bowed Rāma --- Śūrpaṇakhā urges flight from Janasthāna fearing Rāma brilliance --- Śūrpaṇakhā names Rāma Lakṣmaṇa valor and her disfigurement